################### LINEAR REGRESSION (Bivariate) ###########################################

Recall the linear regression model --> y = beta_o + beta_1(X) + epsilon (or u, for standard error)
Formula <-- lm(Y~X)

Manual calculations to find betahat_o <-- mean(y) - betahat_1*mean(x)
Manual calculations to find betahat_1 <-- cov(x,y) / var(x)

OR

betahat <- coef(formula)
y_hat <- fitted(formula)
u_hat <- resid(formula)

Command for display values: eg till 15th row
cbind(y_hat,betahat,u_hat)[1:15]. <-- can add other interested columns

