##################################################################

GOODNESS OF FIT <-- technically the R^2

model <- lm(Y~X)
betahat <- coef(model)
y_hat <- fitted(model)
u_hat <- resid(model)

Calculate R^2 in 3 different ways

1. var(y_hat)/ var(y)
2. 1 - var(u_hat) / var(y)
3. cor(y,y_hat)^2

